1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:03,278
(Sheldon:)What has that vixen done to me,
Leonard?

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:05,115
(Sheldon:)How do I make it stop?

3
00:00:05,612 --> 00:00:09,112
(Leonard:)Well, if you had a physical relationship,
l'd say propose during sex.

4
00:00:09,324 --> 00:00:11,994
Turns out that's a real mood-killer.

5
00:00:12,869 --> 00:00:15,289
- l assume we're talking about you now?
- Yeah.

6
00:00:15,497 --> 00:00:18,787
(Sheldon:)So that's how this works?
l complain and then you complain...

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,500
(Sheldon:)...and no one offers any solutions?

8
00:00:22,629 --> 00:00:24,419
(Leonard:)Pretty much.

9
00:00:24,965 --> 00:00:27,385
(Sheldon:)Well, no wonder the women
are winning.

10
00:00:31,346 --> 00:00:33,556
(Howard:)Mr. Rostenkowski, are you busy?

11
00:00:33,765 --> 00:00:36,225
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Just looking at some old pictures.
Come on in.

12
00:00:36,434 --> 00:00:40,684
Family pictures, or?...
Holy crap, that's a dead person.

13
00:00:41,314 --> 00:00:44,104
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Last murder case before I retired.

14
00:00:44,317 --> 00:00:46,277
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)How many bodies do you see there?

15
00:00:46,486 --> 00:00:49,736
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Careful. It's a trick question.

16
00:00:49,948 --> 00:00:56,118
- I'm not sure.
- No, you'll never get it. It's a fraction.

17
00:00:57,539 --> 00:00:58,579
How about that, heh.

